# Extra inventory paths the monitoring play loads alongside its own
# inventory.yml. Picked up by `just ansible monitoring` (and ansible-check)
# via the .extra-inventories hook in the Justfile.
#
# Why: monitoring scrapes node_exporter on the PVE cluster + pbs01, and
# pbs-exporter's PBS_ENDPOINT also resolves a hostname. Loading these
# inventories at play time means the role can read pve_lan_ip /
# pbs_lan_ip from hostvars to build /etc/hosts entries — IPs stay
# single-sourced in the host-level inventories, no duplication into
# vms/monitoring/ansible/inventory.yml.
#
# Format: one repo-relative inventory path per line. Lines starting
# with # are ignored.
pve-hosts/ansible/inventory.yml
pbs-hosts/ansible/inventory.yml
